Made-in-USA icon — a stylized flag in brand colours, not a literal US flag.
SVG is canonical. Four treatments; navy IS the full-colour one (see README.md).

  ga-icon.svg         navy. The default and the full-colour treatment.
  ga-icon-sand.svg    reversed, sand, on navy or ink in full-colour contexts
  ga-icon-white.svg   reversed, #FFFFFF, black-and-white documents only
  ga-icon-black.svg   single colour, #000000

There is no -navy file: an unsuffixed name already resolves to the navy
treatment, and two filenames for one treatment is one too many.
